                    </StackPanel>
                    <StackPanel Visibility="{variable:Clip8:Collapsed}">
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="1. 掠夺者" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="命令/summon pillager ~ ~ ~ {}会召唤一个不会主动攻击任何实体的“被动的”掠夺者。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="2. 疣猪兽" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4"
                                   Text="Henrik Kniberg发布过一段关于疣猪兽玩笑特性的视频。视频中一群疣猪兽击杀猪灵之后摇晃着脑袋，随后用后脚站立跳起了舞，类似于猪灵的“胜利之舞”。" />
                        <TextBlock TextWrapping="Wrap" Margin="0,0,0,4" FontWeight="Bold"
                                   Text="3. 鞍" />
